                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for jianyu &amp;lt;yujian@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c0f82b26-6e4f-436d-8221-ca1486e4d887" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c0f82b26-6e4f-436d-8221-ca1486e4d887&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_0 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;(10) Expect nothing to be repaired, but got: 98
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master-next/968" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master-next/968&lt;/a&gt; - 6.4.0-150700.53.31-default&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master-next/968" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master-next/968&lt;/a&gt; - 6.12.0-55.43.1_lustre.el10.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;Please provide additional information about the failure here&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;







